			<div class="content" id="post-content-4836704">
									

<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Horror</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> An entity that resembles a female corpse that puts children under the age of 8 to coma. The entity hunts families with a child under the age of 8. It mysteriously crawls out of closets or drawers inside the victim's house at approximately 1~2&#160;o'clock midnight. Then proceeds to sing a<br />
&quot;Lullaby&quot;. The lullaby affects children to wake up from their sleep immediately, but gives a counter effect to adults which puts them to deeper sleep. The child(victim) who lacks a guardian is held firmly by the entity, unable to resist. After the lullaby is over, the entity kisses the victim's forehead which makes the victim fall in a coma. The entity then disappears from the house only leaving a fowl, garlic scent.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong>The article is narrated based on a interview between Scp agent &quot;Joshua&quot; and Robert, the only victim known to recover from the coma. The interview provides gruesome description<br />
of the entity itself and events that happen inside of the coma.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> All victims in the state of coma are to be euthanized for it is the most ethical treatment the Foundation can provide. Also, the containment procedures involves animal sacrifices, torment and more unethical procedures which gives the reader curiosity of the Scp and it's powers.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong>Thank you so much for reading and I really hope to see reviews!!</p>

							</div>

								
					
